<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.1.7">
<l>veḷḷai veḷḷamiṉ mēloru pāmpai</l>
<l rend="indent">mettai yākavi rittataṉ mēlē</l>
<l>kaḷḷa nittirai koḷkiṉṟa mārkkaṅ</l>
<l rend="indent">kāṇa lāṅkoleṉ ṟācaiyi ṉālē</l>
<l>uḷḷañ cōravu kantetir vimmi</l>
<l rend="indent">yurōma kūpaṅka ḷāykaṇṇa nīrkaḷ</l>
<l>tuḷḷañ  cōratu yilaṇai koḷḷēṉ</l>
<l rend="indent">collāy yāṉuṉṉait tattuṟu māṟē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>As [my] hair stands on end, and rejoicing meets sobbing</l>
<l rend="indent">so that [my] heart languishes with desire,</l>
<l>crying out, “is it not possible to see the way that you feign sleep</l>
<l rend="indent">on that vast serpent bed in the white sea?"</l>
<l>I cannot take to [my] bed to sleep</l>
<l rend="indent">such that tears trickle from [my] eyes.</l>
<l>Tell me the way that I can reach you!</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
